                            # currently does.
swin_distill_pre_s2026.pt            # stage one of the logit two-stage (knee-8009 a), distillation-dominant at weight 20 so its heads were a probe not a target, and UNDERTRAINED at 4 epochs still rising; it exists to produce an encoder, never a seat
swin_distill_fit_s2026.pt            # 0.8255 against swin_supervised_s2026's 0.8331 cold control, -0.0077, three starred negative labels and zero starred positives, harness branch checked clean; a trunk driven to imitate a teacher's twelve logits is a worse init than the trunk it started from (interpretations/kneemri/2026-08-31_distilling_logits_is_not_pretraining.md)

